  "total_time": "PT45M",
  "yield": [
    "25",
    "25 dumplings"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Appetizer"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "Korean"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "Korean"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "1 pound ground beef",
    "0.5 cup finely chopped green onions",
    "0.5 cup finely chopped cabbage",
    "0.5 cup finely chopped carrot",
    "0.5 cup minced garlic",
    "4 teaspoons sesame oil, divided",
    "1 tablespoon toasted sesame seeds",
    "0.5 teaspoon monosodium glutamate (such as Ac'cent®)",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste",
    "2 eggs",
    "1.5 cups vegetable oil for frying",
    "1 (16 ounce) package wonton wrappers",
    "3 tablespoons soy sauce",
    "2 teaspoons rice wine vinegar",
    "1 teaspoon toasted sesame seeds, or more to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wNg-fs82OyM_CXaHZOtiRyBlKo8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-245124-yaki-mandu-VAT-step-01-0a358f8b249a4502963e09e26a70da88.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245124/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a large skillet over medium-high heat. Add beef; cook and stir until browned and crumbly, 5 to 7 minutes. Drain and discard grease.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fF8Ij9tAt57m0kKwbbLuOb76lR0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-245124-yaki-mandu-VAT-step-02-369f2b15860a4e2c84f48db7ff7f816b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245124/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix green onions, cabbage, carrot, garlic, 1 tablespoon sesame oil, 1 tablespoon sesame seeds, monosodium glutamate, salt, and pepper into ground beef mixture; cook and stir until liquid is evaporated and vegetables are tender, 5 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5qW8UjCaY4ocRF-lkSA-QdaJdQ8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-245124-yaki-mandu-VAT-step-03-1spatulainframe-262f7b33e4e24837822b2470e3bed4b1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245124/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer beef mixture to a bowl and mix in 1 egg. Meanwhile, heat vegetable oil in a separate skillet over medium heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hCayIyE2TTY_RUsuWFioVhkiOkQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-245124-yaki-mandu-VAT-step-04-1-caeb16849c924f8e9cf8ccaa188663a6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245124/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Crack the second egg into a bowl and beat well.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EVC3Yyrs9jZDxabVX2eEostQrdA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-245124-yaki-mandu-VAT-step-05-9ddef5478fd048a49e5c480128bc771f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245124/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hold 1 wonton wrapper in the palm of your hand and brush a thin layer of beaten egg on 1 edge. Scoop about 1 teaspoon beef mixture into the center of the wrapper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gAvTi-PGzkYBCtgwVSCzEI3i8uE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-245124-yaki-mandu-VAT-step-06-ee5a35d8bc234ccb977338df0c40db73.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245124/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fold wrapper in half, corner to corner, to make a triangle and pinch the edges shut, crimping with your fingers to make a seal.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qTCmZi1MzexcYZl4rXw68IClxL8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-245124-yaki-mandu-VAT-step-07-95099d08ec3c48449be8f49d0d094541.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245124/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Press the air out by cupping your fingers over the dumpling in your palm and pressing lightly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2kxuCaYdbeXRViYF7Pmio-SBa8s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-245124-yaki-mandu-VAT-step-08-baa9c0aad8404f6d8a427189661ac66c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245124/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fry wontons in the hot oil until 1 side is browned, about 1 or 2 minutes. Flip and cook until other side is browned, 1 or 2 minutes. Transfer wontons to a paper towel-lined plate to drain using a slotted spoon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cxgmDQT9eTJ5WjgrVMsyYn3h8d8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-245124-yaki-mandu-VAT-step-09-1slottedspooninframe-1fa1ccdf87c74a58a816d0fd12893842.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245124/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the dipping sauce: Whisk soy sauce, rice wine vinegar, 1 teaspoon sesame oil, and 1 teaspoon sesame seeds together in a bowl until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1xQT7D-KhbVaLPiYEO0kRd6RYK4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-245124-yaki-mandu-VAT-step-10-1c93079b40684ea8854013ed14f3512b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245124/step_10.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve alongside wontons.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KFndmaX-XSOMT7uJvKu4-eyBWH4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-245124-yaki-mandu-VAT-step-11-f7980e5a86a14348a23eba5a9ea31cdb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245124/step_11.webp"
    }
  ],
